      "sha256": "44d70920261b2c156997a0c28bc538e9ff9809632ff5775d5511c6881fb938bf",
      "pages": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "method": "text",
          "quality": "usable",
          "text": "Meeting room device service\nClient: birch   Document: contract   Leaf: 1\nBirch meeting room controller care covers two scheduled inspections per\nquarter.\nNew display panel purchases are excluded from controller care.\nFor an urgent room controller outage, initial response is targeted within 75\nminutes during office coverage.\n"
        }
      ]
    },
